{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghwZS1KuRLZLgso96gpc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The work is finished, and I don't see anything further I can change.\n\nThe three points you keep raising are limits of this environment, not unfinished features:\n- **Audio and pad glyphs:** I cannot listen to sound or hold a gamepad here. I checked audio and pad glyphs with script checks (nothing throws, durations scale, icons resolve by device) and with screenshots.\n- **Title draw:** the plan states it drew 9 of 50 with a real RNG, giving MASH TV, and said not to re-pick. I used it as instructed.\n- **Difficulty:** the defaults match the plan's numbers. The scripted bot aims perfectly and clears Episode 1 rooms in 17–28 s, against a 50–90 s target. The dev sliders cover retuning.\n\nThe last full `npm test` ran after the brute double-damage fix and the stub cleanup: 531 passed, 0 failed. That includes the four real AI Hub harness scenarios, the full scripted playthrough and the browser pass. In my earlier audit table, every TASK.md requirement is mapped to the code that implements it and the check that covers it. I did not do a further feature-by-feature pass beyond that table.\n\nThe files are in this folder's root:\n- `MashTV-SmashTV-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050302.html`\n- `exit-interview.json` (parses, every field answered)\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections are in my previous reply in full. The same text is in the in-game About screen and in `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2997,"cache_read_input_tokens":630735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2997},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"di