{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghwdVaWTby5QuCP5Tc7H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The work is finished, and I have nothing further to change.\n\nThe two things you keep flagging cannot be closed from here:\n- **Title draw:** the plan records its own random draw (9 of 50, giving MASH TV) and tells the builder not to re-pick. Redoing it would mean either renaming the whole game on a new random number or running a draw I would then ignore. I kept the plan's title, as TASK.md and the plan agree on how it was chosen.\n- **Audio, voices and pad glyphs:** I cannot listen to sound or hold a gamepad. They are verified by script and screenshot only.\n\nThe default difficulty also probably runs easier than the plan's target. The scripted bot aims perfectly and clears Episode 1 rooms in 17–28 s. The dev sliders retune it.\n\nThe deliverables are in this folder's root:\n- `MashTV-SmashTV-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-050302.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`, which parses with every field answered\n\nThe last full `npm test` reported 531 passed, 0 failed, run after the brute fix and the stub cleanup. It includes the four real AI Hub harness scenarios, the scripted full playthrough and the browser pass.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections are in my earlier full reply. The same text is in the in-game About screen and in `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":639285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":959},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"592e1de7-5cd9-4b58-be6b-33507bcad868","uuid":"89e9f01e-90